<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - COREStaff restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - COREStaff restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it resumed coverage of COREStaff Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- COREStaff added 1/2 to 29-1/8.</p>
